                <div class="accordian-box">
                    <h3 style="text-align: end;">Membership support</h3>
                    
                    <div class="accordian-box-item active">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>Who is Membership for?</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p><strong>Membership</strong> is open to business professional organizations set as associations, Chambers, cooperatives and industry chains. Our members are drawn from business companies grouped into professional associations all committed to addressing the challenges associated with developing Rwanda’s private sector.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>What are the main categories of membership?</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p>Private Sector Members are grouped into categories according to their sectors e.g. Mining Sector, Chamber of commerce and services, financial institutions sector etc. Under sectorial grouping our members are categorized as:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Golden Circle (Platinum: 20,000,000rwf)</li>
                                    <li>Associate Members.</li>
                                    <li>Indashyikirwa Members.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
                        <div class="accordian-title">
                            <h5>What is the difference between Member and Shareholder</h5>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordian-content">
                            <p>A member is a person whose name is entered in the register of members of a company Whereas a Shareholder is a person who owns the shares of the company.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordian-box-item">
